1
00:00:00,002 --> 00:00:07,007
SafeLedger AI:actual local prototype. Synthetic BDT data and sandbox only. No real money moves.

2
00:00:07,007 --> 00:00:15,080
Cleared balance:BDT 120,000. The backend preserves source IDs and uses exact integer minor units.

3
00:00:15,080 --> 00:00:23,281
Deterministic 30-day outlook:BDT -18,750. Upcoming obligations reveal a reserve shortage.

4
00:00:23,281 --> 00:00:31,637
What-if:delay scheduled receipts by 7 days. The lowest projected balance falls to BDT -59,300.

5
00:00:31,637 --> 00:00:39,794
Fictional financing only. Total costs rank BDT 2,000 /2,100 /2,500. All fail baseline affordability.

6
00:00:39,794 --> 00:00:48,057
Real LLM is not configured at this checkpoint. AI unavailability does not stop deterministic finance.

7
00:00:48,057 --> 00:00:56,393
Duplicate invoice risk:the actual backend rejects INV-104 before it can create a payment proposal.

8
00:00:56,393 --> 00:01:05,815
INV-105:BDT 35,000. The owner creates a signed pending proposal. Creating it moves no funds.

9
00:01:05,822 --> 00:01:15,046
A separate authenticated approver session reviews the payee, amount, source and immutable action hash.

10
00:01:15,047 --> 00:01:22,349
Explicit confirmation enables approval. The backend rechecks permission, expiry, policy and funds before posting.

11
00:01:22,351 --> 00:01:36,549
One sandbox posting completes. Available cash reconciles from BDT 120,000 to BDT 85,000.

12
00:01:36,549 --> 00:01:45,651
The backend verifies the audit chain. Proposal, approval and execution remain linked to one trace.

13
00:01:45,652 --> 00:01:53,666
Open release gates:live-model evaluation, public durable hosting and independent review. Repository contains actual test evidence.
